  "decisions": {
    "B1": "community for isolation: tenant labelling, tenant-scoped tokens and visibility are preserved and enforced (owner decision 2026-11-27); tenant provisioning, membership resolution and cross-tenant delegation stay enterprise",
    "B2": "community",
    "B3": "enforced: a permissions Grant carries a tenant and a revocation epoch and authorize() denies on a missing or mismatched tenant or a stale epoch; the tenant comes from the authenticated identity, never from an argument (owner decision 2026-11-27)"
  },
